Length [text box] - Turntable
Type the Length of the Turntable into the text box.
Remarks
After you inserted it, Plant Simulation shows its length here. The Turntable only rotates parts, which are
shorter or as long as the value, which you enter here.
You can change the length of the graphic and the anchor points of the Turntable by clicking Show
Manipulators 
  on the Edit ribbon tab or by pressing M on the keyboard.
