Rotation Point [text box]
Type the Rotation Point into the text box, i.e., the position of the fulcrum around which the Turntable
rotates.
Remarks
You can type in a value between 0 and the length of the Turntable. 0 designates the point at which you
start inserting the Turntable.
The Center of Rotation is the fulcrum around which the table rotates.
The Start Point is the point which you click, when you start inserting the Turntable.
The End Point is the point which you click, when you finish inserting the Turntable. The circle in the
screenshot below shows all points which the turntable can reach with its end point, when it rotates around
the fulcrum.
SimTalk
RotationPoint [SimTalk]
Rotation Point [text box]
