Rotate When [drop-down list] - Turntable
Select when the Turntable rotates toward its target object.
Remarks
You can select one of these settings:
• When the MU has completely entered the Turntable.
• When the MU has reached the rotation point/the fulcrum on the table.
• When the MU is located in the center of the Turntable, i.e., when both ends of the MU have the same
distance from the edges of the turntable.
• If you want the Turntable to not rotate automatically, but only when the MU has reached a user-defined
sensor, select User-defined with Sensor. In the Sensor Control, you have to tell the Turntable to call
the method setDestination.
