Go to Default Position [check box] - Turntable
To rotate the Turntable back to its Default Position, when the MU has left the Turntable and when no new
MU is ready to be rotated, select this check box.
Remarks
If you select the check box, the Turntable uses the Default Angle, when you reset the model.
Then, type in the default angle at which the default position is located.
