Default Angle [text box] - Turntable
Type the Default Angle into the text box to which the Turntable rotates, when you selected Go to Default
Position.
Remarks
The default position is located at this angle. If you would like the Turntable to rotate to the side on which
the start point is located, add 180 degrees to this angle.
