MU Leaves Backwards Depends On
Type the name of the user-defined attribute of the MU, which triggers its rotation, so that it exits the
table driving backward into the text box.
Remarks
This user-defined attribute can be an attribute of data type boolean or a Method which returns a value of
data type boolean.
MU leaves Backwards Depends On will only be evaluated, when you select Any as the side in the Exit
Angle Table.
SimTalk
