Tab Times [Turntable]
Define Times as described under the Tab Times.
Select a distribution from the drop-down list and type the values that this distribution requires into the
text box. Plant Simulation shows the parameters along the upper border of the tab. You can also select a
constant time (Const).
Note
The Turntable does not provide the Cycle Time.
You can set the type of the distribution and a complete set of parameters with the method
setTypeAndAttr [SimTalk].
